            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jillian"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Wow! This was really good and a complete departure from the typical \"bacon and egg\" wrap I'm used to for breakfast. I cut the recipe in half to give it a try and was pleasantly surprised. Along with the pineapple I added some sliced strawberries and blueberries I had on hand. This was a great way to use cottage cheese and it has a nice crunch from the granola complimented by the sweetness of fresh fruit. Very easy and very tasty!"
          },
