            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Tara Thomas"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The first time I made these, I omitted the sugarand replaced the pineapple with mixed berries. It was ok. The kids were kind of picky about them. The next time, my husband made them. He is the type to grill EVERYTHING so, of course, he tried to grill these. Definitely an improvement!! He made them without the sugar as well and replaced the pineapple with blueberries. I will definitely be grilling these again.",
            "datePublished": "2011-06-06T18:25:11.960Z"
          },
          {
