            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jeri Edwards"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was just ok in my opinion. I think I would prefer a regular while wheat tortilla over the carb balance. Other than that, the flavors were kind of weird but I think it has great potential. Going to try to sub honey for brown sugar next time, maybe mix in some greek yogurt with the cottage cheese? \nI will say it was very filling though. By lunch time I was still pretty satiated so I only had a small lunch. I recommend cutting down on the amount of ingredients too. I halved the recipe to only make one, and the tortilla was so full I could barely close it!!",
            "datePublished": "2021-10-06T17:42:49.410Z"
          },
