              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Molly"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I love cottage cheese for breakfast, so I was very intrigued with this recipe. I did sub strawberries for the pineapple, one- because I had them and two- because I'm not real big on pineapple and cottage cheese together. This was a great filling breakfast. I would make them again the same way. I feel you could omit the brown sugar and it will be just as good. Thanks Katie for a new breakfast idea.",
